import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as r}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 754 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter | The Increment-Development Principle of Matter Creation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 754 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter | The Increment-Development Principle of Matter Creation","no":754,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter","Increment Development","Anti-Predation","Matter Creation","Myriad-Origin Two-Way Cycle"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law","07-Self-Generated Self-Grown Evolution Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0754_模块4-超多元级物质-增量开发原则.md","filePath":"en/0754_模块4-超多元级物质-增量开发原则.md"}'),o={name:"en/0754_模块4-超多元级物质-增量开发原则.md"};function a(s,e,l,c,m,d){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[r('<h1 id="entry-754-hyper-multiverse-grade-matter-the-increment-development-principle-of-matter-creation" tabindex="-1">Entry 754 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter | The Increment-Development Principle of Matter Creation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-754-hyper-multiverse-grade-matter-the-increment-development-principle-of-matter-creation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 754 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Matter | The Increment-Development Principle of Matter Creation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 15, 07</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-stock-is-a-zero-sum-game-increment-is-a-positive-sum-game" tabindex="-1">Introduction: stock is a zero-sum game; increment is a positive-sum game <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-stock-is-a-zero-sum-game-increment-is-a-positive-sum-game" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: stock is a zero-sum game; increment is a positive-sum game&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The anti-predation axiom&#39;s core statement is &quot;develop increment, do not consume stock.&quot; In the matter domain, this principle has a concrete name: the Increment-Development Principle. It requires Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cultivators, when creating matter, prioritize the route of &quot;weaving new matter from zero&quot; over the route of &quot;digging existing veins.&quot; This is not moral preaching, but <strong>economic calculation</strong> — stock development is zero-sum; increment development is positive-sum.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are increment development&#39;s skeleton: the anti-predation axiom directly defines increment development; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires increment results be shared; the collective ascension axiom requires increment accelerate uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires increment development not disturb stock; the law-first axiom requires increment development&#39;s laws be self-consistent.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-stock-development-vs-increment-development" tabindex="-1">I. Stock Development vs. Increment Development <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-stock-development-vs-increment-development" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Stock Development vs. Increment Development&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Stock Development (Mining)</th><th>Increment Development (Weaving)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Resource source</td><td>Existing veins, heaven-treasures</td><td>New matter woven in the law network</td></tr><tr><td>Total quantity change</td><td>Dig less, have less</td><td>Weave more, have more</td></tr><tr><td>Ecological impact</td><td>Damages earth veins</td><td>Zero damage</td></tr><tr><td>Distribution logic</td><td>Whoever grabs it owns it</td><td>Myriad-Rank sharing</td></tr><tr><td>Long-term trend</td><td>Resource depletion → war</td><td>Resource abundance → peace</td></tr><tr><td>Civilizational effect</td><td>Computable power used less and less</td><td>Computable power used more and more</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This table lists the two modes&#39; fundamental differences clearly. Stock development&#39;s endpoint is resource depletion; increment development&#39;s starting point is infinite resources.</p><h2 id="ii-the-three-layer-route-of-increment-development" tabindex="-1">II. The Three-Layer Route of Increment Development <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-three-layer-route-of-increment-development" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Three-Layer Route of Increment Development&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s matter increment development does not jump to &quot;weave new-cosmos matter from zero&quot; at once, but progresses through three layers:</p><p><strong>Layer 1 · Efficiency Raising</strong> Do not increase total matter quantity, but raise existing matter&#39;s utilization to the limit. For example:</p><ul><li>Put every atom of a piece of law alloy to its sharpest use, no waste;</li><li>Recycle old matter discarded in cultivation, reweave into new material;</li><li>Reduce matter loss during production.</li></ul><p>This layer does not create new matter, but through efficiency raising is equivalent to &quot;having extra matter.&quot;</p><p><strong>Layer 2 · Cycle Reengineering</strong> Recycle used matter, disassemble, reweave into new matter. For example:</p><ul><li>Law alloy recycled and recast after old buildings are demolished;</li><li>Energy crystals recycled and rewoven after cultivation consumption;</li><li>Sorting and recycling of matter waste in Myriad Ranks&#39; daily life.</li></ul><p>This layer lets matter cycle infinitely within civilization, requiring no constant new mining.</p><p><strong>Layer 3 · Weaving from Zero</strong> When cycle reengineering is still insufficient, directly weave entirely new matter at the law layer. This is increment development&#39;s highest stage, and the core ability of Balanced-Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm cultivators.</p><h2 id="iii-why-increment-development-is-not-a-free-lunch" tabindex="-1">III. Why Increment Development Is Not a &quot;Free Lunch&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-increment-development-is-not-a-free-lunch" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why Increment Development Is Not a &quot;Free Lunch&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Someone may ask: since increment development is so good, why not weave everything from zero from the start? The answer is: <strong>increment development has costs.</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Weaving cost</strong>: every unit of new matter woven consumes the cultivator&#39;s computable power and energy;</li><li><strong>Testing cost</strong>: new matter must pass stability testing; testing itself consumes resources;</li><li><strong>Distribution cost</strong>: new matter must be fairly distributed to Myriad Ranks; the distribution mechanism itself has operating costs.</li></ul><p>So increment development is not &quot;free matter appearing out of thin air,&quot; but &quot;spending cost to create new matter.&quot; It is just that this cost is far lower than stock development&#39;s social cost (war, destruction, inequality).</p><h2 id="iv-increment-development-s-priority" tabindex="-1">IV. Increment Development&#39;s Priority <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-increment-development-s-priority" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Increment Development&#39;s Priority&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s matter development has clear priority:</p><ol><li><strong>Efficiency raising</strong> first — first use existing matter to the extreme;</li><li><strong>Cycle reengineering</strong> second — supplement with recycling and rewaving;</li><li><strong>Weaving from zero</strong> last — only activate when the first two steps are insufficient.</li></ol><p>This priority ensures law-weaving ability is not abused — only when &quot;using old things to the extreme&quot; and &quot;recycling old things and rewaving&quot; both cannot meet demand is the highest-cost weaving-from-zero mobilized.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: stock development digs finite veins less and less; increment development lets total matter continuously grow, fundamentally eliminating waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: increment development needs not grab others&#39; ore, directly eliminating predation&#39;s motive</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s matter is gift-style stock allocation — how much ore Gu Chensha has, who he gives to; Heng Yuan Zhou is increment-style co-creation — Myriad Ranks together weave new matter</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: increment development&#39;s results are distributed through the Myriad-Rank sharing mechanism, not monopolized by the strong</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: increment development&#39;s technologies (weaving, recycling, testing) are all open network-wide through the Selfless Dao</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Increment-Development Principle is the anti-predation axiom&#39;s economic landing in the matter domain. It proves one thing: <strong>peace is not maintained by moral preaching, but by the economic reality that &quot;without grabbing, you can still live better.&quot;</strong> When weaving is more cost-effective, fairer, and more sustainable than mining, predation loses its reason to exist.</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/15-能量循环与转化法则.html">Entry 15 · Energy Cycle and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/07-自生自长进化法则.html">Entry 07 · Self-Generated Self-Grown Evolution Law</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/22-资源分配联产承包机制.html">Entry 22 · Resource-Allocation Joint-Production-Contract Mechanism</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const p=t(o,[["render",a]]);export{h as __pageData,p as default};
